BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 254.5 Td (Low-cost crop insurance. Crop insurance against natural disasters, pests and disease;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 240.5 Td (farmers pay 2% for kharif, 1.5% for rabi and 5% for commercial or horticulture crops.) Tj ET
