BT /F2 12.5 Tf 56 769.0 Td (3. Enrolment) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 750.0 Td (How do I apply?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 736.0 Td (Enrol through your bank, a Common Service Centre, the insurance company or the PMFBY portal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 722.0 Td (before the season's last date.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 703.0 Td (What should I bring?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 689.0 Td (Aadhaar, Land records or tenancy agreement, Bank account, Sowing certificate. Bring them in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 675.0 Td (person; never read document numbers out on the phone.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 656.0 Td (Do I have to pay to apply?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 642.0 Td (There is no fee to apply. Any premium or contribution is only what is stated under What it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 628.0 Td (gives. Never pay anyone or share an OTP to apply.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 56 601.0 Td (4. Utilisation) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 582.0 Td (How do I know if I'm already enrolled?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 568.0 Td (The agent asks: "Are you already covered under PM Fasal Bima Yojana?") Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 549.0 Td (I'm enrolled. How do I get the benefit?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 535.0 Td (Guidance for the agent: Explain that using the cover means making a claim when something) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 521.0 Td (happens: contact the bank, office or insurer where they enrolled, or the official helpline,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 507.0 Td (as soon as possible because claims have time limits. If the cover is renewed every year or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 493.0 Td (season, remind them to renew it in time.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 56 466.0 Td (5. Support) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 449.0 Td (Problems people often report:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 434.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 434.0 Td (Benefit or payment not received) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 419.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 419.0 Td (Asked for money) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 404.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 404.0 Td (Name or details wrong) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 389.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 389.0 Td (Refused at office or hospital) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 374.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 374.0 Td (Delay) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 359.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 359.0 Td (No response from helpline or office) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.0 Tf 56 340.0 Td (I have a problem. What should I do?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 326.0 Td (Contact the helpline 14447 or the official website pmfby.gov.in. If that doesn't solve it,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 312.0 Td (file a complaint on the government grievance portal, pgportal.gov.in.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 295.0 Td (Don't argue about whether the problem is real, don't promise it will be fixed or by when,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 281.0 Td (and don't ask for any ID, card, account or phone number.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 56 254.0 Td (6. Feedback) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 237.0 Td (Ask for consent first, then these questions in order:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 222.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 222.0 Td (Do you know how to make a claim if you need to?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 207.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 207.0 Td (How easy was it to apply and get the benefit, from 1 to 5?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 192.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 192.0 Td (How helpful were the office, bank or helpline staff, from 1 to 5?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 177.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 177.0 Td (Did anyone ask you for extra money to get this benefit?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 162.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 162.0 Td (What one thing would make this scheme work better for you?) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 56 135.0 Td (Never) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 120.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 120.0 Td (Say someone is definitely eligible.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 105.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 105.0 Td (Invent amounts, dates, deadlines or rules.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 90.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 90.0 Td (Ask for Aadhaar, bank account, card, OTP or PIN numbers, or any payment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 75.0 Td (Х) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 78 75.0 Td (Keep talking after the person asks to stop.) Tj ET
